{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月3日美國中期選舉當天，法國視覺藝術家喬安妮·勒梅爾西耶（Joanie Lemercier）在社交媒體上發佈照片及視頻，展示其團隊在拉斯維加斯特朗普國際酒店外牆實施的一場燈光投影行動。藝術家利用激光投影設備，在酒店原有的巨大「TRUMP」標識旁投射出「OUT」字樣，組成「TRUMP OUT」（特朗普下台）的抗議標語。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584992.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T09:05:45.677315+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T08:51:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T08:58:30.371665+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T08:58:30.371665+00:00","content_hash":"d6f12b3a84d9ab00febb94a43a0c063bcaf2d12b62daf34edd931d565100a2bb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}